> =B7	Don't wear any rings for long other than SD. Conflict seems to
> make you hungry very quickly, so I didn't use it much. Levitation
> didn't seem to be much of a problem.

Conflict, regeneration, and hunger are the big three when it comes to
ring hunger. Natural nutrition (which =3DoSD removes) is one point of
hunger every turn. Conflict, regeneration, and hunger are each a point
of hunger every other turn. The other rings (including =3DoSD) is one
point of hunger every twentieth turn.

Since you mentioned you had two rings of slow digestion, you could
abuse an exploit that allows you to prolong yourself infinitely without
using any nutrition. Ring hunger is calculated on different turns for
each hand. So you put both rings of slow digestion on, and every 4/20th
turn you remove the left ring for a turn, and every 12/20th turn you
remove the right ring for a turn. I imagine it's incredibly tedious,
but it'll keep you alive if you have no other options.

